WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
It's hard being a Polish fanboy in Dagestan.

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:05.800
You think you're serving looks, but the mountains do not care about your mesh crop top.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.640
Your dad sent you for a spiritual rebirth, but now you're stuck in a cousin's goat shed,

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:11.800
learning how to wrestle so the locals respect you.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.240
Every night you post thirst traps on an old Nokia,

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:18.360
praying someone from Warsaw slides into your DMs and pays for your bus ticket home.

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:22.520
Your biggest flex, your eyeliner stays sharp even after you've been chased off the hillside

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:25.280
by an angry uncle who thinks you're an undercover tax inspector.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:26.280
But you're not alone.

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:30.080
Azerbaijan Technology is trialing a special femboy resettlement program

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:32.420
for Polish runaways stranded in the Caucasus

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:35.720
Each participant gets a free crop top and a coupon for mutton stew

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:38.960
Wear the Polish air fryer tea and show Dagestan who you really are

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:41.180
Get yours now at childrenofkhan.com

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:42.000
